  "provenance": {
    "origin": "Derived from approved sprite masters and top-tier keys; no AI concept pixels copied. Carl portrait and System CRT face are the frozen top-tier keys (assets/source/hud/keys/), pixels unchanged, lone 1 px details re-keyed to same-colour accent aliases for the strict lint. Donut portrait is a 28x28 1:1 crop of assets/source/characters/donut/donut_h40.grid.json frame 0 (x 14..41, y 4..31) with four edge pixels repainted. Frames, strips, notice frame, glyphs, icons and tags are original pixel-grid-v1 art written by scripts/author_hud_hybrid_a.py from the design spec (sections 2, 3, 7). The AUDIENCE-01 viewer eye, arrows and digits are copied pixel-exact from the top-tier keys in the PR #118 design review. HUD-ART-02: key_j, key_right, chip_dynamite and chip_puddle are the frozen top-tier keys (assets/source/hud/keys/hud_art_02_*), copied pixel-exact (lone 1 px details re-keyed to same-colour accent aliases for the strict lint); key_k, key_l, key_q, key_space, key_left and key_down are drawn from the spec's cap construction and 5x5 symbols; notice_frame is the HA2-AD3 plate, equal to the frozen notice-plate key. The HUD concept PNGs were never sampled, traced or cropped.",
    "generator": "Design and keys: Claude Opus. Execution (portrait crop, frames, glyphs, icons, tags, atlas, validators, evidence): Claude Sonnet via scripts/author_hud_hybrid_a.py. Independent review: pending, a separate top-tier agent. No image-model raster output.",
